  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STEM for One Planet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As the world advances towards the 2030 deadline for achievement of the Sustainable Development Goals, innovative solutions are to be co-developed and co-implemented in a trans-disciplinary manner are required, involving wider range of stakeholders in society.However, these integrated multi-disciplinary skills are still lacking across much of Asia and the Pacific. 
The purpose of this project is to develop evidence-based critical thinking and inquiry-based solution production capacity through STEM/STEAM (Science Technology Engineering Arts and Mathematics) for high-schoolers and graduate students in selected countries.</narrative>
  </description>
